type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts#L102","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts:102"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"props","children":[{"type":"text","value":"props"}]},{"type":"code","value":"readonly props: InputSignal<TProps>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts#L98","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts:98"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"class-flexrenderdirectivetfeatures-trowdata-tvalue-tprops","text":"Class: FlexRenderDirective<TFeatures, TRowData, TValue, TProps>","level":1},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"trowdata","text":"TRowData","level":3},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":3},{"id":"tprops","text":"TProps","level":3},{"id":"constructors","text":"Constructors","level":2},{"id":"constructor","text":"Constructor","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"content","text":"content","level":3},{"id":"injector","text":"injector","level":3},{"id":"props","text":"props","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Class: FlexRenderDirective\\<TFeatures, TRowData, TValue, TProps\\>\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts:84](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts#L84)\n\nUse this utility directive to render headers, cells, or footers with custom markup.\n\nNote: If you are rendering cell, header, or footer without custom context or other props,\nyou can use the [FlexRenderCell](FlexRenderCell.md) directive as shorthand instead .\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nimport {FlexRender} from '@tanstack/angular-table';\n\n@Component({\n  imports: [FlexRender],\n  template: `\n     <td\n       *flexRender=\"\n         cell.column.columnDef.cell;\n         props: cell.getContext();\n         let cell\"\n     >\n       {{cell}}\n     </td>\n\n     <th\n       *flexRender=\"\n         header.column.columnDef.header;\n         props: header.getContext();\n         let header\"\n       >\n       {{header}}\n     </td>\n\n     <td\n       *flexRender=\"\n         footer.column.columnDef.footer;\n         props: footer.getContext();\n         let footer\"\n     >\n       {{footer}}\n     </td>\n  `,\n})\nclass App {\n}\n```\n\nCan be imported through FlexRenderDirective or [FlexRender](../variables/FlexRender.md),\nwith the latter preferred.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TRowData\n\n`TRowData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue` *extends* `CellData`\n\n### TProps\n\n`TProps` *extends*\n  \\| `NonNullable`\\<`unknown`\\>\n  \\| `CellContext`\\<`TFeatures`, `TRowData`, `TValue`\\>\n  \\| `HeaderContext`\\<`TFeatures`, `TRowData`, `TValue`\\>\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew FlexRenderDirective<TFeatures, TRowData, TValue, TProps>(): FlexRenderDirective<TFeatures, TRowData, TValue, TProps>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts:109](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts#L109)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`FlexRenderDirective`\\<`TFeatures`, `TRowData`, `TValue`, `TProps`\\>\n\n## Properties\n\n### content\n\n```ts\nreadonly content: InputSignal<FlexRenderInputContent<TProps>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts:93](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts#L93)\n\n***\n\n### injector\n\n```ts\nreadonly injector: InputSignal<Injector>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts:102](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts#L102)\n\n***\n\n### props\n\n```ts\nreadonly props: InputSignal<TProps>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts:98](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts#L98)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: FlexRenderDirective\ntitle: FlexRenderDirective\n---\n\n# Class: FlexRenderDirective\\<TFeatures, TRowData, TValue, TProps\\>\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts:84](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts#L84)\n\nUse this utility directive to render headers, cells, or footers with custom markup.\n\nNote: If you are rendering cell, header, or footer without custom context or other props,\nyou can use the [FlexRenderCell](FlexRenderCell.md) directive as shorthand instead .\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nimport {FlexRender} from '@tanstack/angular-table';\n\n@Component({\n  imports: [FlexRender],\n  template: `\n     <td\n       *flexRender=\"\n         cell.column.columnDef.cell;\n         props: cell.getContext();\n         let cell\"\n     >\n       {{cell}}\n     </td>\n\n     <th\n       *flexRender=\"\n         header.column.columnDef.header;\n         props: header.getContext();\n         let header\"\n       >\n       {{header}}\n     </td>\n\n     <td\n       *flexRender=\"\n         footer.column.columnDef.footer;\n         props: footer.getContext();\n         let footer\"\n     >\n       {{footer}}\n     </td>\n  `,\n})\nclass App {\n}\n```\n\nCan be imported through FlexRenderDirective or [FlexRender](../variables/FlexRender.md),\nwith the latter preferred.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TRowData\n\n`TRowData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue` *extends* `CellData`\n\n### TProps\n\n`TProps` *extends*\n  \\| `NonNullable`\\<`unknown`\\>\n  \\| `CellContext`\\<`TFeatures`, `TRowData`, `TValue`\\>\n  \\| `HeaderContext`\\<`TFeatures`, `TRowData`, `TValue`\\>\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew FlexRenderDirective<TFeatures, TRowData, TValue, TProps>(): FlexRenderDirective<TFeatures, TRowData, TValue, TProps>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts:109](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts#L109)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`FlexRenderDirective`\\<`TFeatures`, `TRowData`, `TValue`, `TProps`\\>\n\n## Properties\n\n### content\n\n```ts\nreadonly content: InputSignal<FlexRenderInputContent<TProps>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts:93](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts#L93)\n\n***\n\n### injector\n\n```ts\nreadonly injector: InputSignal<Injector>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts:102](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts#L102)\n\n***\n\n### props\n\n```ts\nreadonly props: InputSignal<TProps>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts:98](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/flexRender.ts#L98)\n"}
